{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12308280","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12308280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230828001:1":{"text":"위로 고마워요. 저도 그때를 기다리고 있죠...","source_cn":"谢谢你的安慰，我也在等着封锁解除。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54B2AB004228EB57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230828002:1":{"text":"하지만 지금은 바다로 나가려는 배가 없으니 창고에 물건을 보관할 수밖에 없어요.","source_cn":"不过现在，既然没有船只愿意出海，我就只能将货物存放在仓库里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99CBBF6E87079492","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230828003:1":{"text":"판매자가 말한 것처럼 유통기한이 몇 년 정도는 남았으면 좋겠네요.","source_cn":"希望那些货物的保质期如同卖家所说，能放数年。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4754B806C3D7C1F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人科博":{"text":"상인 코보","source":"商人科博","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}